{"parentUuid":"e5a3b268-e48c-4428-b396-9167e50896af","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx1gcDxExKiTfmeLHs7W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016PZevwEzQSUFvqkGxwUJ9i","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('DECISIONS.md').read()\nlines=s.split('\\n')\ni=[k for k,l in enumerate(lines) if l.startswith('| D46 |')][0]\nlines.insert(i+1,\"| D47 | A link may be a failure link: when its step fails, the job goes along it instead of back to the step that writes. A failure link orders nothing, so it may go back to an earlier step; a step reached only by failure links is skipped otherwise. The failing step's revisions bound any loop, and past them a person decides. A step has at most one failure link. |\")\nopen('DECISIONS.md','w').write('\\n'.join(lines))\np='PLAN.md'; s=open(p).read()\ni=s.index('## After this plan')\nj=s.index('## Open questions')\ns=s[:i]+'''### U11. Workflows that branch (D47)\n\n- A link may be a failure link. When its step fails, the job goes along\n  it instead of back to the step that writes.\n- A failure link orders nothing, so it may go back; a step only failure\n  links reach is skipped otherwise.\n- The failing step's revisions bound a loop; past them a person decides.\n- The canvas draws a failure link red and dashed; a picked link has an\n  \"On failure\" box.\n\nDone 2026-11-11. Live, on a copy of Short whose checks exit 1 and whose\nfailure link goes to a lights-on `report` step: plan and build ran, the\nchecks failed, the job went to `report` instead of back to build,\n`report` ran, and the job waited there; it was stopped so nothing\nlanded. The canvas drew the link red and dashed.\n\nKnown gap: the job's steps show a step that failed and branched as done,\nas the job keeps no outcome per step.\n\n'''+s[j:]\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncargo fmt --all -- --check && scripts/check-seams.sh | tail -1 && CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings 2>&1 | grep -E \"^error\" -A6 | head; CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 cargo test --workspace 2>&1 | grep -E \"FAILED|panicked\"; git add PLAN.md DECISIONS.md crates","description":"Record D47 and U11; CI; stage","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2756,"cache_read_input_tokens":826765,"output_tokens":1086,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":70},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2756,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1086,"cache_read_input_tokens":826765,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2756,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2756},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_016PZevwEzQSUFvqkGxwUJ9i":{"command":"cd /Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion && python3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('DECISIONS.md').read()\nlines=s.split('\\n')\ni=[k for k,l in enumerate(lines) if l.startswith('| D46 |')][0]\nlines.insert(i+1,\"| D47 | A link may be a failure link: when its step fails, the job goes along it instead of back to the step that writes. A failure link orders nothing, so it may go back to an earlier step; a step reached only by failure links is skipped otherwise. The failing step's revisions bound any loop, and past them a person decides. A step has at most one failure link. |\")\nopen('DECISIONS.md','w').write('\\n'.join(lines))\np='PLAN.md'; s=open(p).read()\ni=s.index('## After this plan')\nj=s.index('## Open questions')\ns=s[:i]+'''### U11. Workflows that branch (D47)\n\n- A link may be a failure link. When its step fails, the job goes along\n  it instead of back to the step that writes.\n- A failure link orders nothing, so it may go back; a step only failure\n  links reach is skipped otherwise.\n- The failing step's revisions bound a loop; past them a person decides.\n- The canvas draws a failure link red and dashed; a picked link has an\n  \"On failure\" box.\n\nDone 2026-11-11. Live, on a copy of Short whose checks exit 1 and whose\nfailure link goes to a lights-on `report` step: plan and build ran, the\nchecks failed, the job went to `report` instead of back to build,\n`report` ran, and the job waited there; it was stopped so nothing\nlanded. The canvas drew the link red and dashed.\n\nKnown gap: the job's steps show a step that failed and branched as done,\nas the job keeps no outcome per step.\n\n'''+s[j:]\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncargo fmt --all -- --check && scripts/check-seams.sh | tail -1 && CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings 2>&1 | grep -E \"^error\" -A6 | head; CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 cargo test --workspace 2>&1 | grep -E \"FAILED|panicked\"; git add PLAN.md DECISIONS.md crates","description":"Record D47 and U11; CI; stage","timeout":600000}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_016PZevwEzQSUFvqkGxwUJ9i":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"e4e7d330-0add-472e-a062-0af21e3d575b","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cgx1gbgDGXJVr9Dhbx2q4","attributionMcpServer":"cmux-cua","attributionMcpTool":"get_window_state","type":"assistant","uuid":"a2df2fdc-731f-4a7a-b5ca-143691372557","timestamp":"2026-11-11T23:31:39.649Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
