{"parentUuid":"056193d6-166f-49b5-bb5d-7276a8b26eb1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx3aFUbtDzZMd4WKB3bR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The gap from U11 is fixed: the job page shows a failed step as failed, and a step the job passed by as skipped. It's committed as U12 (`4a241c0`) and pushed, and CI passed on Linux and macOS.\n\n- **Failed:** each job keeps which steps last failed. A step that passes on a later run comes off that list.\n- **Skipped:** a step that only failure links lead to shows \"skipped\" when no failure led there. Once the job finishes, any later step shows \"skipped\" rather than \"pending\".\n- **Live:** I ran the Branch test workflow again. Its steps read plan done, build done, checks failed, report waiting. I stopped the job, so nothing landed.\n\nEvery phase in PLAN.md is now done. Before I start anything new, two things need a decision from you:\n\n1. **Test leftovers on `local`:** the workflows \"Short, options test\", \"Command test\" and \"Branch test\", and a test commit in my scratch repo `demo-local`. Should I delete the three workflows?\n2. **Your `bastion-gh` workspace** (`~/Code/bastion`) has no charter now, because it only has `.claude/` files. Should I copy its rules into `AGENTS.md` and `.agents/settings.json` in that repository, or will you do it?\n\nWhat should the next plan cover?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":186,"cache_read_input_tokens":851477,"output_tokens":425,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":186,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":425,"cache_read_input_tokens":851477,"cache_creation_input_tokens":186,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":186},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"355fe28c-0824-4058-aa16-3eee477e17e8","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgx3aF7XMtCShi6KtFkaZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"dfa95bcd-d39f-4295-ad58-98afe5222641","timestamp":"2026-11-11T23:56:23.007Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
